nd`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"4ae6d196b88cd641276ffddcef3a94de","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"8a4cd0deb99e3768a335afe4a1c01ed9","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"395e49e42087a0fb5864fd766af5c888","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"8c4b7c2e895306c106812229d85ea84f","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"a5c2dd70a9c32d2853532a0faba8b712","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"5b0b475bb3b199523be91c1a31c6bb78","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"f462d87b1543b27ed6f013f6bd96ae98","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"47e2c9a46d4d1a8af4afd85f58bd6334","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"b7fdda9e44b8297521ea5d13f38078d8","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1794843331972,"stop":1794843332075,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value